{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "mutation-and-the-balance-it-sets",
  "title": {
    "en": "Mutation and the balance it sets",
    "zh": "突变及其设定的平衡"
  },
  "kind": "theorem",
  "status": "recorded-checked",
  "family": "F01",
  "reviewed_at_utc": "2026-10-22T14:52:46+00:00",
  "statement": {
    "en": "Carriers losing m offspring to mutation hold their share exactly where their advantage s balances the loss, at s / (s + m), approached from below without overshoot; with no advantage they decline whatever their share. It is the balance of Price's equation, selection against transmission.",
    "zh": "因突变失去 m 个后代的携带者，恰在其优势 s 抵消损失处保持份额，即 s / (s + m)，自下方无超越地趋近；无优势时无论份额为何都下降。此平衡即选择与传递的 Price 平衡。"
  },
  "laws": [
    {
      "en": "Carriers leaving k carrying offspring and m not, others w: the carriers' share rises exactly where d k exceeds c m + d w, is kept where they are equal and falls where d k falls short.",
      "zh": "携带者各留 k 个携带后代与 m 个不携带的，其余各留 w 个：携带者份额恰在 d k 超过 c m + d w 时上升，相等时保持，不足时下降。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.step_balance",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.rises_iff",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.kept_iff",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.falls_iff"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Where k <= w the share never rises and with any loss falls at every step, whatever it is: the error threshold.",
      "zh": "k <= w 时份额从不上升，有任何损失即每步下降，无论其为何：误差阈值。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.never_rises",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.falls_of_outrun"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Where k = w + s the share is kept exactly at s / (s + m); a run at or below that balance stays at or below it, its share never falling, and one above stays above.",
      "zh": "k = w + s 时份额恰保持于 s / (s + m)；在此平衡处或其下开始的过程保持在其处或其下、份额从不下降，在其上者保持在其上。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.kept_share",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.below_stays",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.above_stays",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.run",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.below_always",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.not_falls_below",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.above_always"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Read as generations of descent, transmission lowers the amount by c m and raises nothing, and the step is balanced exactly where the count balance holds: mutation-selection balance is the balance of Price's equation.",
      "zh": "按世代读，传递使该量降低 c m、不升高任何，该步恰在计数平衡成立处平衡：突变与选择的平衡即 Price 平衡。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.holds",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.offspring",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.generations",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.total_replicate",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.total_kinds",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.lowered_count",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.size_first",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.sum_first",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.size_next",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.sum_next",
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Mutation.balanced_iff"
      ]
    },
    {
      "en": "Witness: one carrier and one other, at the threshold falling from a half to two of five, and a half kept at the balance.",
      "zh": "见证：一个携带者与一个其他成员，在阈值处由一半降到五分之二，在平衡处保持一半。",
      "declarations": [
        "Becoming.Reproduction.Threshold.at_threshold"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "en": "No axiom. Two kinds; loss in one direction only; constant offspring numbers k, m and w.",
      "zh": "不加公理。两类；只单向损失；后代数 k、m、w 恒定。"
    }
  ],
  "does_not_show": [
    {
      "en": "Back mutation, and mutation with drift (the balance of mutation and drift).",
      "zh": "回复突变，以及伴随漂变的突变（突变与漂变的平衡）。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "That a run converges to the balance: started below it, it stays at or below it and its share never falls.",
      "zh": "过程收敛于平衡：自其下方开始时保持在其处或其下，份额从不下降。",
      "kind": "scope"
    },
    {
      "en": "That keeping the carriers is better: the counts read the share; ranking goes through the comparison C.",
      "zh": "保住携带者更好：计数读的是份额；排序经由比较 C。",
      "kind": "non-implication"
    }
  ],
