  "correspondence": {
    "en": "Mutation-selection balance (Haldane 1927) and the error threshold (Eigen 1971): a haploid carrier share at equilibrium (w1(1 - u) - w0)/(w1 - w0), here s / (s + m) in counts. Readings (the AI's): mutation is the transmission term the selection term's course already carries.",
    "zh": "突变与选择的平衡（Haldane 1927）与误差阈值（Eigen 1971）：单倍体携带者的平衡份额 (w1(1 - u) - w0)/(w1 - w0)，此处为计数中的 s / (s + m)。读法（AI 的）：突变即选择项进程本已带有的传递项。"
  },
